Prestigia.com is an exclusive collection of 40000 quality four & five star hotels in the most demanded destinations in the world. Our travel experts have carefully picked the trendiest hotels, so you won't have to risk even one night's stay.

Thanks to the "Prestigia Hotels" app, you can, among other things:
- Access our special prices and deals for hotels from your iPhone and book safely;
- Find available hotels for tonight by locating nearby hotels;
- Refine your search by using several filters (Price, neighborhood, recommendation, services...etc);

- View HD pictures of every part of the hotel of your choice;
- Check the comments of previous guests to make your experience more enjoyable;
- View our maps to organize your travel to the Hotel;

- Create your Prestigia account or open it if you already have one;
- Check your bookings, and modify or cancel them on your mobile device;

- Give your feedback about your experience.
You can also call our customer service directly on your phone to assist you with any question you might have.

We speak your language: the app is available in 6 languages and supports 40 currencies.
